  }
 ],
 "synopsis": "Sunil Singhania-led Abakkus Asset Manager has filed its draft red herring prospectus with SEBI for an initial public offering. The proposed IPO consists entirely of an offer for sale of 1.5 crore shares, which will be offloaded by the promoter, Abakkus Expert Professional. For the financial year 2026, the company reported revenue of Rs 796 crore and a profit after tax of Rs 327 crore. Axis Capital, ICICI Securities, IIFL Capital, and JM Financial are acting as the lead managers to the issue. The company operates in investment management and advisory services with a focus on equity strategies across alternates, offshore, private equity, and mutual funds.",
